"⚠️ [📞Endpoint] [非法操作] {context} | 不存在的Endpoint, "
"检查是否非法调用：{namespace}.{endpoint}"
msgstr ""
"⚠️ [📞Endpoint] [Ungültige Operation] {context} | Nicht existierender "
